kVRhd4qNFcEwLL4A","tags":["AI News"],"accent":"#51525a","available":true,"companyId":null,"createdAt":"2026-08-09T17:06:45.055Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-23T14:59:03.857Z","author":{"name":"AI Search","avatar":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/GV5UTW2IlP29PhsLKm65ue4LZYXxMyPV5YQdfE6GVgv9KH1_y_8kCirPGfpVn9yTJuNBvVHktEE=s0"}},{"id":"c8b9d192c6a1465ea804227af6f578b4","slug":"multi-query-attention-mqa-and-grouped-query-attention-gqa-explained","title":"Multi Query Attention (MQA) and Grouped Query Attention (GQA) explained !!","description":"In this video you will learn about how Multi Query Attention (MQA) and Grouped Query Attention (GQA) helps to optimize the inference of LLM using the KV cache.  Before watching this video, first watch the KV Cache: https://youtu.be/RGC-azaTXsI?si=DU8IW2DLmTjNK5VD  Timeline: 0:00 - Intro 1:52 - Multi Query Attention (MQA) 3:58 - Grouped Query Attention (GQA)  Resources: Multi Query Attention (MQA) Paper https://arxiv.org/pdf/1911.02150  Grouped Query Attention (GQA) https://arxiv.org/pdf/2305.13245","toolName":"Under The Hood","toolCategory":"llm","youtubeId":"sKdQL8Bg4_o","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/sKdQL8Bg4_o/hqdefault.jpg","durationSeconds":391,"views":667,"likes":33,"publishedAt":"2026-08-09","channelId":null,"tags":["educational-content"],"accent":"#1d9e75","available":true,"companyId":null,"createdAt":"2026-08-28T08:46:22.860Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-28T08:46:22.860Z","author":{"name":"Under The Hood","avatar":"https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=UN&background=random"}},{"id":"a6080fdeaf2145e3b722081f74c40701","slug":"the-most-legendary-engineer-in-ai-history-just-left-google-after-27-yearshere-is-what-that-means","title":"The Most Legendary Engineer in #AI #history  Just Left Google After 27 Years—Here Is What That Means","description":"Jeff Dean joined Google as roughly employee #30, when the company had 25 people. Twenty-seven years later, on August 5-6, 2026, he posted his final message and left — taking Senior Fellow Sanjay Ghemawat, DeepMind VP and Gemini co-lead Oriol Vinyals, and Google Brain co-founder Quoc Le with him to found Discovery Loop, a public benefit corporation aimed at automating scientific discovery. Google is a founding investor.  The same afternoon, Demis Hassabis stepped back as CEO of Google DeepMind, moving to Chair of DeepMind and Chief Scientist of Alphabet — Jeff Dean's former title. Koray Kavukcuoglu, DeepMind's CTO for 13+ years, steps up to lead Gemini 4 development directly under Sundar Pichai. Alphabet stock fell roughly 5% — an estimated $160-200 billion in market value in one session.  This video covers who Jeff Dean is and what he built, who's leaving with him, what changes at Google DeepMind, how this fits the pattern of departures since June 2026 (Noam Shazeer to OpenAI, John Jumper to Anthropic), and the financial backdrop: Google's first-ever negative cash flow quarter against a $205 billion 2026 AI capex forecast, with Gemini 3.5 Pro still unreleased.  CHAPTERS: 0:00 Jeff Dean's departure, and Hassabis stepping down 0:26 Who Jeff Dean is 1:30 Who is leaving with him 2:23 What happens to Google DeepMind 3:24 The pattern before this — June to August 4:08 The financial context 4:56 Opinion 5:50 Subscribe + comment  #AI #Google #DeepMind #JeffDean #TensorFlow #AINews #TechLeadership","toolName":"AI News","toolCategory":"llm","youtubeId":"JnO70GAjUOk","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/JnO70GAjUOk/hqdefault.jpg","durationSeconds":372,"views":93,"likes":3,"publishedAt":"2026-08-09","channelId":null,"tags":["educational-content"],"accent":"#7f77dd","available":true,"companyId":null,"createdAt":"2026-08-28T08:46:22.860Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-28T08:46:22.860Z","author":{"name":"AI News","avatar":"https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=AI&background=random"}},{"id":"cmsm21lfy0003psp7db7hu2ki","slug":"openais-controversial-ai-devic-hFkcEP","title":"OpenAI’s Controversial AI Device Just Leaked… And It’s Literally a Donut","description":"Live aggregated review co